{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1153486-conjunctional-creativity-all-spheres-at-3","id":1153486,"title":"Conjunctional Creativity - All Spheres at 3","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-27T08:32:55-07:00","id":1153486,"title":"Conjunctional Creativity - All Spheres at 3","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">You have all of the Spheres at level 3. What sort of conjunctional effects does that lend itself too? </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">I've never had a character that wasn't just focused on one or two spheres, and I'm trying to be creative, avoid old habits and get inspired.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Background:</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">We're playing a bi-weekly M20 game with pre-generated characters. I'm an Orphan with the &quot;Gods and Monsters' paradigm and a background in science, an interest in the occult and a youth spent in a military academy.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Here my character bio: </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">&quot;Selene knows only one life, being on Tower. The mega structure that protects earth from demonic creatures from beyond. Her adopted mother, the Admiral, has given her the best that the battle station could offer. All her life was a military life style with structure and rules that needed to be followed. Growing up has been one of privilege and of status above all peers. Never popular in school and always the outsider, she could only depend on her adopted siblings (the other 2 PCs) for support. That has always been the status quo for them, we depend on each other and mother will always be there for us. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Selene has always been the most passionate one. She loves hard, fights hard, lives life fully. When she was young all that was apparently how she was going to be until she started going to flight academy. Her first year her attitude changed dramatically she became reclusive and temperamental. Her foul attitude nearly drove her family to intervene in her life but something occurred and since then she has been on a slow track to being the women they all remembered.&quot; </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Now we are on earth for the first time -- Our home overrun by invaders who were after us, and more.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/19407-miami-ken","name":"Miami-Ken","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-27T09:11:54-07:00","id":1153496,"title":"","content":"You have universal countermagic. While using all of them at once might never come up, you can do lot. You can find nearly everything anywhere, you can affect any kind of supernatural being with lvl 3 powers. Basically there's nothing you can't control, understand, or counter...but only to a small extent. The possibilities are a bit staggering. It's also weird, to have them ALL at that specific level.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-30T20:15:56-07:00","id":1154282,"title":"","content":"You're also the go-to person for making Charms (items endowed with one-use Effects that can be used by anyone, and have had all the rolls done ahead of time so you know the Effect will work). So long as you have sufficient Quintessence and time, you can give yourself or your allies the ability to use most basic Effects on the fly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}